cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CDALabeller: Label Cell Death Areas in Agroinfiltration Images"
abstract: "A Shiny app for drawing bounding boxes around cell death areas (CDAs) in agroinfiltration images and recording a cell death severity score from 0 to 6 for each. The annotations are exported as a CSV file that AutoCDAScorer reads."
authors:
